- badge.tsx
- button.tsx
- card.tsx
- checkbox.tsx
- dialog.tsx
- dropdown-menu.tsx
- input.tsx
- label.tsx
- popover.tsx
- select.tsx
- separator.tsx
- skeleton.tsx
- sonner.tsx
- switch.tsx

For each shadcn component, change the import path from `@/lib/utils` to `../../lib/utils` (relative import since this is a package).

**6. packages/ui/src/index.ts** - Main entry point that re-exports everything
```ts
// Utils
export { cn } from "./lib/utils";

// Types (CSS-related)
export type { ClassValue } from "clsx";

// UI Components
export { Badge, badgeVariants } from "./components/ui/badge";
