**5. Copy all shadcn/ui component files**

Read the existing shadcn components from the root `src/components/ui/` directory and copy each one to `packages/ui/src/components/ui/`. The files are:
- badge.tsx
- button.tsx
- card.tsx
- checkbox.tsx
- dialog.tsx
- dropdown-menu.tsx
- input.tsx
- label.tsx
- popover.tsx
- select.tsx
- separator.tsx
- skeleton.tsx
- sonner.tsx
- switch.tsx

For each shadcn component, change the import path from `@/lib/utils` to `../../lib/utils` (relative import since this is a package).

